  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING: No HSTS and HTTPS redirection are supported anymore. Instead all HTTP requests will be answered with a 400.\n- BREAKING: EnvironmentHelper moved to namespace devdeer.Libraries.Utilities\n- BREAKING: ConfigurationExtensions.ConfigurationExtensions now is set to \"EntraId\".\n- BREAKING: AdGroupClaimAuthorizationHandler was renamed to EntraIdGroupClaimAuthorizationHandler.\n- BREAKING: AdGroupClaimAuthorizationRequirement was renamed to EntraIdGroupClaimAuthorizationRequirement\n- BREAKING: The config extensions ConfigureDefaults() and ConfigureServices() no longer take config options in.\n- Fixed TFM symbols.\n- Using ValueTask<> instead of ValueTask<> as result type.\n- New ConfigurationOptions.EntraIdConfigurationSectionKeyOverride allows to override the default \"EntraId\" value for configuration key retrieval from IConfiguration.\n- devdeer.Libraries.NLogExtensions is now used and automatically configured.\n- Package updates.",
